 "title": "The circle x² + y² = 25 and the parabola y = x² − 5",
 "caption": "Bézout allows up to 4 intersections. Substituting gives y² + y − 20 = 0, so y = 4 or −5: the points (3, 4), (−3, 4) and (0, −5), where the parabola touches the circle's bottom.",
